			"isDeleted": false,
			"text": "⭐ Final Takeaways\n\n• Security is layered (Defense in Depth)\n• Misconfiguration is the #1 risk\n• Least Privilege is essential\n• Patching must be continuous\n• Hardening reduces attack surface\n• OS security = limit impact, not just block\n• A well-secured system fails safely",
